"text","text":{"content":"本文介绍了一些著名的黑客和相关事件，包括Kevin Mitnick、Anonymous、Adrian Lamo、Albert Gonzalez以及Matthew Bevan和Richard Pryce。黑客文化有着复杂的历史，既有破坏性行为，也有追求正义和安全改进的行为。黑客可以分为白帽黑客、灰帽黑客、黑帽黑客和社会工程师。黑客精神强调技术能力、创新、自由探索和对知识的热爱。然而，黑客活动涉及道德和法律问题，黑客应该明确自己的责任和义务，并在合法的框架下进行技术共享。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"本文介绍了一些著名的黑客和相关事件，包括Kevin Mitnick、Anonymous、Adrian Lamo、Albert Gonzalez以及Matthew Bevan和Richard Pryce。黑客文化有着复杂的历史，既有破坏性行为，也有追求正义和安全改进的行为。黑客可以分为白帽黑客、灰帽黑客、黑帽黑客和社会工程师。黑客精神强调技术能力、创新、自由探索和对知识的热爱。然而，黑客活动涉及道德和法律问题，黑客应该明确自己的责任和义务，并在合法的框架下进行技术共享。","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"9652a69a-2498-4c02-b404-bc9180bf1ffc","name":"黑客","color":"pink"},{"id":"d2c72849-94d8-4f61-8829-b11289559407","name":"hacker","color":"pink"},{"id":"aae4c043-a26e-400c-93b1-6592f26b98db","name":"黑客精神","color":"gray"},{"id":"90c0091f-d659-4fea-b33b-501881efc38f","name":"黑客工具","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"0b5e042e-bbbe-45cd-9d42-a36a8527cbb5","rawId":"0b5e042ebbbe45cd9d42a36a8527cbb5","slug":"0b5e042ebbbe45cd9d42a36a8527cbb5","title":"安装Archlinux参考命令","date":"2023-11-19","summary":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"Archlinux参考命令","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"Archlinux参考命令","href":null}],"categories":[{"id":"8282ff59-f160-40c3-ab7e-6e970a0a64d5","name":"技术分享","color":"purple"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"c2d30c8f-feaa-40fd-948a-8323eb7098b6","name":"Linux","color":"default"},{"id":"9df48350-7065-4e8e-825a-91001ad281fc","name":"Archlinux","color":"yellow"},{"id":"d109bc3d-bc03-4026-a753-170e5750dd34","name":"命令","color":"pink"}]},{"id":"1699d559-67cb-462b-890c-772aa227bfdc","rawId":"1699d55967cb462b890c772aa227bfdc","slug":"1699d55967cb462b890c772aa227bfdc","title":"网络安全图解",